        <div class="impact-card"><div class="k">SEO ARTICLES</div><div class="v">6</div><div class="desc">6 SEO articles, each with search markup.</div></div>
        <div class="impact-card"><div class="k">FUNNEL STAGES</div><div class="v">6</div><div class="desc">All 6 lead stages tracked in the dashboard.</div></div>
        <div class="impact-card"><div class="k">ZAPIER FOOTPRINT</div><div class="v">1 ZAP</div><div class="desc">Automation moved into code. One trigger left, the rest is code.</div></div>
        <div class="impact-card"><div class="k">VOICE STACK</div><div class="v">4</div><div class="desc">Vapi, Claude Haiku, Deepgram Nova-3, ElevenLabs. The qualifying caller.</div></div>
