      </div>
      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">Every lead can be followed from the ad click to the reward. Clinic routing is automatic. The calling window and STOP handling run in code, not on a checklist.</p>

      <h2 style="margin-top: 44px;">Running in production.</h2>
      <p>The system has been calling and texting real patients since June 2026, and the platform kept growing after the initial three systems: a patient portal with OTP login and insurance-card upload, a recall CRM for the front desk, and a digital consent-forms portal now run alongside Anna. Operating volume as of early July 2026:</p>
      <div class="impact-grid">
        <div class="impact-card"><div class="k">LEADS IN THE PIPELINE</div><div class="v">700+</div><div class="desc">Every one tracked from ad click through qualification to booking, with automatic clinic routing across 7 partner clinics.</div></div>
