        <div class="impact-card"><div class="k">RESPONSE TIME</div><div class="v">SECONDS</div><div class="desc">New leads get a text immediately and a call from Anna inside the compliant calling window.</div></div>
        <div class="impact-card"><div class="k">REWARD COHORT</div><div class="v">120+</div><div class="desc">Patients through the completion-reward program, verified and fulfilled through the same pipeline.</div></div>
        <div class="impact-card"><div class="k">DAILY INTAKE</div><div class="v">30–50</div><div class="desc">Leads per day at current campaign volume, up from 8 at launch.</div></div>
        <div class="impact-card"><div class="k">COMPLIANCE</div><div class="v">BUILT-IN</div><div class="desc">CASL consent and STOP handling, CRTC calling windows, PHIPA-conscious data handling. Enforced in code.</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="confidential">
        <strong>Note:</strong> Volumes above are operating metrics from the system I run; the dashboard screenshots earlier on this page show the same pipeline. Conversion rates, booking-to-revenue, and financial results are the client's to disclose and aren't shown here.
      </div>

